hamsterdan-readiness
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of Hamsterdan's V5 PR-readiness net
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of
src/hamsterdan/readiness/net_v5/*.py and src/hamsterdan/readiness/payloads.py,
and its test suite ports the upstream tests in
tests/unit/readiness/net_v5/ and tests/unit/readiness/test_payloads.py.
The committed corpora under test/corpus were produced by running the
upstream code with the scripts in scripts/.

